Package: qqs
Title: A lightweight R package for streamlined research project setup with Quarto
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Tristan", "Muno", , "trismuno@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: A lightweight R package that exposes a single `qqs()` helper for quickly scaffolding new research projects. Based on personal experience and preferences, it creates a pre-specified folder structure for data and code along with several files, including a PDF `manuscript.qmd` source file, a Reveal.js `presentation.qmd` source file, an HTML `code/00_code_template.qmd` notebook, a `references.bib` bibliography template, and a `.gitignore` file for version control.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
